{"unit_id":"dingminhua__dsh-service-portal#card-zh","repo":"dingminhua/dsh-service-portal","commit":"1d582eb0bb9ca72acbe52ccada3a8301f8776afb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-service-portal 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的本机服务门户插件。它在设置页提供入口，并由本机门户管理服务注册和路由。用户可通过局域网地址与二维码访问，也可手动开启 cloudflared 公网隧道；门户支持设置口令、增删服务节点、启用或屏蔽路由，并显示服务访问入口。适合需要从手机或外网访问本机 Web 服务的 DSH 用户。运行需本机 Python；公网访问需预先安装 cloudflared。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1605-1625","client/index.jsx:2060-2105","tools/portal_run.py:360-399"]}
{"unit_id":"dingminhua__dsh-service-portal#card-en","repo":"dingminhua/dsh-service-portal","commit":"1d582eb0bb9ca72acbe52ccada3a8301f8776afb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-service-portal is a DSH plugin for local service access. Its settings page displays a LAN address and QR code; users manage service routes and can open a temporary cloudflared tunnel. It helps reach local web services remotely. Requires Python and, for public access, cloudflared.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1605-1625","client/index.jsx:2060-2105","tools/portal_run.py:360-399"]}
